                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Congress must provide for our rural health providers the way they provide for the patients they serve. The North Carolina Rural Health Association is doing its part to address the health disparities we face in the East and across our state, including unacceptably high levels of maternal mortality, chronic disease, and provider shortages.",
