                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For our rural communities to thrive, we must ensure everyone has access to lifesaving healthcare coverage, without leaving anyone behind. To that end, we are cosponsoring the following three bipartisan bills supporting health insurance for patients and their families:\u00a0\n\n\u25aa\ufe0fH.R. 5145, the Bipartisan Premium Tax Credit Extension Act, a bill to extend the Affordable Care Act (ACA) premium tax credits which are set to expire by the end of 2025, and which ensure healthcare remains affordable for 70,000 NC-01 residents and millions of others throughout rural communities and America.\n\n\u25aa\ufe0fH.R. 3885, the Community TEAMS Act of 2025, legislation to amend the Public Health Service Act to provide community-based training opportunities for medical students in rural areas and medically underserved communities.\n\n\u25aa\ufe0fH.R. 3514, the Improving Seniors\u2019 Timely Access to Care Act of 2025, legislation to cut red tape for patients requiring secondary referrals to specialists from primary care providers, therefore removing often burdensome paperwork requirements.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1758556159,
                "view_count": 736
