                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Although a government shutdown is in effect, here\u2019s what you can count on:\n\n\u2705 Social Security & SSI checks will still be delivered\n\u2705 Medicare & Medicaid benefits will continue\n\u2705 VA hospitals & benefits remain open and available\n\nSome services may be slower, but our office is here to help. Call us at (202) 225-3101 with any questions or concerns.",
