                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Eastern North Carolinians are voicing serious concerns about a 114% average increase in their healthcare premiums, which is set to take effect in 2026 unless Congress intervenes. \n\nHere\u2019s what Ronita, a small business owner, said: https://t.co/RDqJ1TbdFe",
