                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\ud83e\uddf5As America endures the longest government shutdown in U.S. history, we heard directly from constituents who rely on the Affordable Care Act (ACA) Marketplace for their healthcare. They shared serious concerns about rising premiums and uncertainty as Congress continues to debate the future of healthcare.",
