                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We have filed legislation to award the Congressional Gold Medal to Marine Corps and Navy Vietnam veterans who served on flight crews responsible for vital helicopter support missions, including the medical evacuation of around 189,000 patients. Recognizing these extraordinary heroes is long overdue!",
